WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,140
Brother Xiao, are you going back?

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,140
Well, where else could we go?

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,140
I said otherwise I would treat you to dinner tonight

4
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,140
Okay. Where to eat?

5
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,140
Let’s go, let’s go to the food stalls and I’ll treat you to something.

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,140
I ate here, so I don’t need to eat when I go back.

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,140
The remaining food can be distributed to the common people.

8
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,940
Brother Xiao, do you want to have a drink?

9
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,940
No, I have to eat even if I don’t have a week.

10
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:19,940
Okay, sit down and let's order

11
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,940
Boss lady, would you like to order?

12
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,970
Boss lady

13
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:24,970
A portion of this salted fish and eggplant filling is a portion of this filling

14
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,970
And a copy of the speculation book

15
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:27,970
A piece of sizzling pork offal

16
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:28,970
A piece of dry old powder

17
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,970
That's enough. I won't be able to finish it later. It's a waste.

18
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:31,970
It's okay, we can eat

19
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,970
Boss lady, this is enough food, right?

20
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:35,970
Yes, you can eat whatever you want

21
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:39,220
That's no need, that's fine

22
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:42,220
Brother Xiao, I have made a lot of money following you these days.

23
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,220
And I'm not as tired as before

24
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,220
I thank you today and specially treat you to a meal

25
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,220
By the way, do you drink alcohol or not?

26
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,220
Yes What do you like to drink?

27
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,220
Is it beer or liquor?

28
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,220
uh what is beer

29
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:59,370
This thing really works

30
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:00,370
I'm so tired

31
00:01:00,370 --> 00:01:02,370
This thing feels very cool in the stomach

32
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:03,370
Love it, love it
